    "slug": "bottlenecks-dont-disappear",
    "title": "Bottlenecks Don't Disappear. They Move.",
    "subtitle": "A field note on constraints, second-order effects, and what stays scarce",
    "kind": "field-note",
    "published": "2026-09-13",
    "description": "Improving a constrained system relocates its bottleneck rather than removing it — and generative AI moved the constraint from production to judgment.",
    "readingMinutes": 13,
    "wordCount": 2897,
